    "name": "MUDBIRD",
    "steam_appid": 3572720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE CASCADIA ISLANDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Down here, you\u2019ll have your very own personal island to farm on and explore-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wait, is that right?\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YUP! YOUR VERY OWN PERSONAL ISLAND!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the cheap price of only 1 thousand macaroni, you can get right to work on your island! You\u2019ll start off small, with a cheap house and rusty supplies, but you\u2019ll decorate and design it until it feels just like home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/e7d85cb1f13fba145e312eb0e1d9b53f.poster.avif?t=1752354046\" width=640 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/e7d85cb1f13fba145e312eb0e1d9b53f.webm?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/e7d85cb1f13fba145e312eb0e1d9b53f.mp4?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY SEEDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy your seeds on the phone from Hector\u2019s Seed Shop! Luckily for you, he offers  next-day-delivery- right to your island!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW FLOWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the hustle and bustle of life on the mainland to sit back and grow some good old homemade flowers! Annuals, perennials, you name it! Grow as many flowers as you can!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/cd1c479e653db16620574efa994a5761.poster.avif?t=1752354046\" width=640 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/cd1c479e653db16620574efa994a5761.webm?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/cd1c479e653db16620574efa994a5761.mp4?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SELL YOUR HARVEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the week, you can sell your seeds by the docks! The Mudbird Flower Company will happily take your hard earned plants off your hands and bring them to the mainland!- In exchange for many macaroni, of course!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY GARDEN DECOR AND UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well now that you\u2019re rich off flower money, whatcha gonna buy? Head down to the shops to grab some fish n chips, a flashlight, or even a lawn flamingo!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/f8fd74dcc2393ee0a4d60b88ef95120d.poster.avif?t=1752354046\" width=640 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/f8fd74dcc2393ee0a4d60b88ef95120d.webm?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/f8fd74dcc2393ee0a4d60b88ef95120d.mp4?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s the catch though- you\u2019ll have to get to the shops all the way across the archipelago!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZIPLINE YOUR WAY ACROSS ISLANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give the Western Zipline Company a ring to grab a zipline pass or even gather the materials to build your own cross-island system, but either way, you\u2019ll have to swing across the islands somehow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/dc96a3719cea80fa1e66581a50ed65c2.poster.avif?t=1752354046\" width=640 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/dc96a3719cea80fa1e66581a50ed65c2.webm?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/dc96a3719cea80fa1e66581a50ed65c2.mp4?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>**Don\u2019t worry! the ziplines are mostly safe!**</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENJOY THE NATURAL BEAUTY OF THE ISLAND RANGE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax, and take in the breathtaking ambience of the islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/b7e771c212fb30756f2594c0d2f4223c.poster.avif?t=1752354046\" width=640 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/b7e771c212fb30756f2594c0d2f4223c.webm?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/b7e771c212fb30756f2594c0d2f4223c.mp4?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s all you need to know to start your journey! See you round the islands?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE CASCADIA ISLANDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Down here, you\u2019ll have your very own personal island to farm on and explore-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wait, is that right?\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YUP! YOUR VERY OWN PERSONAL ISLAND!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the cheap price of only 1 thousand macaroni, you can get right to work on your island! You\u2019ll start off small, with a cheap house and rusty supplies, but you\u2019ll decorate and design it until it feels just like home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/e7d85cb1f13fba145e312eb0e1d9b53f.poster.avif?t=1752354046\" width=640 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/e7d85cb1f13fba145e312eb0e1d9b53f.webm?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/e7d85cb1f13fba145e312eb0e1d9b53f.mp4?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY SEEDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy your seeds on the phone from Hector\u2019s Seed Shop! Luckily for you, he offers  next-day-delivery- right to your island!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW FLOWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the hustle and bustle of life on the mainland to sit back and grow some good old homemade flowers! Annuals, perennials, you name it! Grow as many flowers as you can!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a