ng to grab a zipline pass or even gather the materials to build your own cross-island system, but either way, you\u2019ll have to swing across the islands somehow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/dc96a3719cea80fa1e66581a50ed65c2.poster.avif?t=1752354046\" width=640 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/dc96a3719cea80fa1e66581a50ed65c2.webm?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/dc96a3719cea80fa1e66581a50ed65c2.mp4?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>**Don\u2019t worry! the ziplines are mostly safe!**</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENJOY THE NATURAL BEAUTY OF THE ISLAND RANGE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax, and take in the breathtaking ambience of the islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/b7e771c212fb30756f2594c0d2f4223c.poster.avif?t=1752354046\" width=640 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/b7e771c212fb30756f2594c0d2f4223c.webm?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/extras/b7e771c212fb30756f2594c0d2f4223c.mp4?t=1752354046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s all you need to know to start your journey! See you round the islands?</p>",
